    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_ABJURER": "Abjurer",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_ABJURER_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Promotion Abjurer, for casters of level 4 or more. While an Abjurer is on the field:[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]enemy hexes have no effect on its side, the pre-battle hexes included;[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]at the start of each round after the first, the enemy side's charms end. A caster casts each charm once, so they are not cast again.",
